                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Only in Japan. I never thought anyone could combine \"educational\" with \"strategically covered nudity,\" yet here we are. I thought this was a joke tag, but it's not! I personally don't mind that, so it didn't affect my review, but just a headsup for those who do.\n\nAnyway, except for one \"damsel in distress\" type scene, which was too on the nose for my taste, this was a pleasant experience. You learn some daily life details about Japan in addition to history and pop culture. This is NOT a hentai VN, it's an educational game wrapped into a visual novel. The visual novel itself is just alright, but I wasn't expecting a masterpiece anyway (only so much you can do with an educational game). Recommended as an educational game for adults, lukewarm recommendation as a visual novel. There is a post-credit scene, by the way.\n\nNote: all achievements are tied to the 2016 DLC, so if you're going for completion, you'll get zero achievements without that DLC.",
